  {
   "id": "q8",
   "number": "8",
   "type": "mcq_single",
   "stem": "Tom has thrice as much money as his sister, Sharon. If Sharon has 45, how much money must Tom give Sharon so that they will have an equal amount of money ?\n\n![figure](asset:q8-stem-fig)",
