    {
     "label": "D",
     "text": "![45](asset:q8-optD)"
    }
   ],
   "answer": "D",
   "solution": "![D Amount of money Tom has = 45 × 3 = 135 Difference between the amount Tom & Sharon have = 135 – 45 = 90 90 ÷ 2 = 45 Tom must give sharon 45](asset:q8-sol)",
